        <a href="/research/helfrich-2024-ssrn-4772016">prices as gradients of convex potentials ↗</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="quiet-routes" aria-label="Ways to work with Ian">
      <a href="/job-market">
        <span class="quiet-routes__index">01</span>
        <div>
