        </div>
        <strong>Open the candidate page <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></strong>
      </a>
      <a href="/start?problem=learning&source=home-hero">
        <span class="quiet-routes__index">02</span>
        <div>
          <h2>Private teaching</h2>
          <p>Econometrics, statistics, microeconomics, macroeconomics, business strategy and marketing, Python and SQL, mathematics, and exam preparation.</p>
        </div>
        <strong>Start a teaching brief <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></strong>
      </a>
